        "text": "Safe vs. Unsafe Baby Sleep Environments: The Ultimate Guide Medically Reviewed by Gina Posner, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "c89a6598c162cddda419963d94cd47f5cbed3a468d298841005d654a17a5ed47",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "8 Walking Safety Tips for Toddlers to Keep Spills and Hazards at Bay Fact Checked by Christine Gordon",
        "text_sha256": "086ec9d5de7ebda411d019f0d5e9930eab8c42d7068c8029ad58783018700917",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Is It Safe for Babies to Sleep in Car Seats? Medically Reviewed by Lauren Crosby, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "4e1c5a94615067794b18ab5548ddffea7d0b96b2c611a393520561069e8ff4ba",
        "word_count": 17
